Module governance.input.refs.case13.
Profile "eu-ai-act-high-risk".

Define GuardContext has amount as Decimal, tier as Text, band as Text, meta as Map Text to Text.
Define GuardRequest has principal_roles as List of Text, action as Text, context as GuardContext.

Rule h1 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h2(c).

Rule h2 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h3(c).

Rule h3 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h4(c).

Rule h4 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h5(c).

Rule h5 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h6(c).

Rule h6 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h7(c).

Rule h7 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return h8(c).

Rule h8 given c as GuardContext, produce Bool:
  Return c.amount at least 1.

@id("R-1")
@control("EU_AI_ACT:ART14")
Rule decide given req as GuardRequest, produce Verdict:
  If h1(req.context):
    Return Verdict.escalate("deep").
  Return Verdict.allow().
